              "id": "phillip_journal",
              "title": "Phillip's black journal",
              "text": "The early pages are Phillip's tidy hand: the small powers he used to carry have gone out of him, and he cannot say where they went. Adela begs him in the margins to stop and be still. A later page is about the Ghostlight Express and the night it let them off at the Hollow, and the last lines say that if the folk here will have them, he means to spend what he has left on helping the Hollow."
            }
          },
          "failure": {}
        },
